# defined-as-exists-inferred (#270 disc 461 code-review cases)
library "Pol".

// #270 inferred-lane `defined as exists` consumers that pre-flip would have thrown
// or mis-lowered. Each is a coherent bare-scalar boolean on the inferred lane:
//   - `Has Adult`      : exists over a records concept (the baseline #270 form).
//   - `Adult Alias`    : a bare-ref ALIAS to an exists concept (Claude #1) — must
//     re-export BARE, never `.satisfied()` a scalar.
//   - `Adult Or Senior`: a `sem-or` composition OVER two exists concepts (Claude #2)
//     — must flip to boolean `or`, never `union` two scalar Booleans.

concept "Adult Records":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `adult`.

concept "Senior Records":
- type is Observation.
- shape is RecordSet.
- code is `senior`.

concept "Has Adult":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Adult Records" ).

concept "Has Senior":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as exists ( "Senior Records" ).

concept "Adult Alias":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as "Has Adult".

concept "Adult Or Senior":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Has Adult" sem-or "Has Senior" ).

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Triage":
- when "Adult Alias" then recommend activity "Refer".
- when "Adult Or Senior" then recommend activity "Refer".
